    "Built-in Microphone is recommended for the fastest and most reliable dictation." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle of the Mic Input card in Settings. Shown when no microphone is chosen. Built-in Microphone is the macOS name for the Mac's own microphone; use the name macOS uses in this language.",
