    "Your %@ mic may be muted. Check System Settings or switch the input device in KeyVox Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the warning panel shown near the dictation pill when the microphone sends no audio. %@ is the microphone's name. KeyVox Settings is the KeyVox settings window. System Settings is the macOS app; use the name macOS uses in this language. KeyVox is a brand name and stays in English.",
